{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6C7236E9","title":"Return to Clem","entry":"Dlg_6C7236E9::entry","exit":"Dlg_6C7236E9::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_5FACAA60","articyId":"72057611218058481","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Hey, thanks SO much for filling in with the delivery. Appreciate it. Sal treat you OK?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, thanks SO much for filling in with the delivery. Appreciate it. Sal treat you OK?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":475.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21714","byteOffset":16105008,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_4BC0F7C2","articyId":"72057611218058507","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Ha, he’s kinda salty when he’s working. Which is, you know, all the time. But he’s a sweetheart really. Or at least a umami-heart.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha, he’s kinda salty when he’s working. Which is, you know, all the time. But he’s a sweetheart really. Or at least a umami-heart.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19681","byteOffset":15329104,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_739B0BAD","articyId":"72057611218058522","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Listen, you want another job? I gotta go to the Spire for a few days, and I hate saying no to my customers...","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Listen, you want another job? I gotta go to the Spire for a few days, and I hate saying no to my customers...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1974.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44715","byteOffset":31248608,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_BBBE06AA","articyId":"72057611218058548","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Ugh, some CEO wants me to grow an overnight flower meadow for his daughter's birthday. They got drone-bees, holoflies, a pony, the works. Sick, huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ugh, some CEO wants me to grow an overnight flower meadow for his daughter's birthday. They got drone-bees, holoflies, a pony, the works. Sick, huh?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30645","byteOffset":19474112,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_6D603FE8","articyId":"72057611218058562","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"It's like a furry HOVA with stilts instead of landing pads. With a cellulose input port at the front.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's like a furry HOVA with stilts instead of landing pads. With a cellulose input port at the front.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3125.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51311","byteOffset":33825792,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_8D5CE113","articyId":"72057611218058585","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Claro, no problem. Well, you know where I am. But if I'm ever gone for more than a few days and you can't find me...","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Claro, no problem. Well, you know where I am. But if I'm ever gone for more than a few days and you can't find me...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27392","byteOffset":18243856,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_1429F7D1","articyId":"72057611218058611","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Just... remember to help others out, yeah? Same way I helped you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just... remember to help others out, yeah? Same way I helped you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43729","byteOffset":30873576,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_CA728117","articyId":"72057611218058617","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Forget it, it's not your problem. See you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Forget it, it's not your problem. See you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19983","byteOffset":15444312,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_E333CF26","articyId":"72057611218058632","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Me? I'm just a gardener. But it'd be nice to know some people still care, despite everything.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me? I'm just a gardener. But it'd be nice to know some people still care, despite everything.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4024.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29160","byteOffset":18913416,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_EEFB41EB","articyId":"72057611218058641","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Claro. It's the same deal as before. See what the client wants, grow it, send it. Easy as peas. I'll transfer their details to your HUD.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Claro. It's the same deal as before. See what the client wants, grow it, send it. Easy as peas. I'll transfer their details to your HUD.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26392","byteOffset":17866336,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_8B56090D","articyId":"72057611218058656","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Thanks, greenfingers. I owe you.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks, greenfingers. I owe you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4600.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28587","byteOffset":18699848,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_7E87E709","articyId":"72057611218058488","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, he paid me.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, he paid me.","TextSheVersion":"Well, he paid me.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, he paid me."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":775.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39532","b